        "title": "Throughout history, people have dreamed of living in a perfect society, but they have not agreed on what an ideal society would be like.  What do you think is the most important element of a perfect society in the modern world?  How can we work towards...",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IZgbdsOgyoskN5xj2fjl2LxegDe\"><em><strong>Throughout history, people have dreamed of living in a perfect society, but they have not agreed on what an ideal society would be like. </strong></em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SI8PdE0ZDoOShhxdNiAlmcPZg7e\"><em><strong>What do you think is the most important element of a perfect society in the modern world? </strong></em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FACPduf7do3LGexLE3DlaJ6Vgeb\"><em><strong>How can we work towards achieving an ideal society?</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTzNd8mj9oUwbFx0MFilTG8bg97\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Ideal Society</em></p>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTzNd8mj9oUwbFx0MFilTG8bg97\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1. Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LGDQdWiIvohAS0xObhKlh062gjf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HNYbdc2YjoB37dxoQGTlC1jsgUe\">\n<ul>\n<li>Đề b&agrave;i Ideal Society&nbsp;y&ecirc;u cầu bạn tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm về hai vấn đề:\n<ol>\n<li>Yếu tố quan trọng nhất của một x&atilde; hội l&yacute; tưởng trong thế giới hiện đại l&agrave; g&igrave;?</li>\n<li>L&agrave;m thế n&agrave;o để ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể hướng tới việc x&acirc;y dựng một x&atilde; hội l&yacute; tưởng?</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>Đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một chủ đề kh&aacute; trừu tượng v&agrave; c&oacute; thể c&oacute; nhiều c&aacute;ch tiếp cận kh&aacute;c nhau. Bạn cần đưa ra &yacute; kiến cụ thể cho cả hai c&acirc;u hỏi n&agrave;y.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CaaPdALkUoj39UxqBaClSdzHg7g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2. Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY&nbsp;</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZOO2dHUkAoCdQHxoIXwl6579g8f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NwFwdHB3foNelPxGFbElyjn9gjY\">Trong b&agrave;i n&agrave;y YouPass đ&atilde; chọn c&aacute;ch trả lời như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WFOsdUcmpoHSgYxK74MlTfB2gde\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Yếu tố quan trọng nhất: Mọi người đều được tự do theo đuổi ho&agrave;i b&atilde;o của m&igrave;nh&nbsp;</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GvEbdXi2wock5yxIgc6lws8Qg9b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>C&aacute;ch thức đạt được: Ch&iacute;nh phủ v&agrave; c&aacute;c gia đ&igrave;nh phải đi đầu trong việc th&uacute;c đẩy x&atilde; hội ph&aacute;t triển</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZQgvdM6loo1oryxGY2blKmC6gSh\">B&agrave;i luận sẽ được chia th&agrave;nh 2 BODY paragraph ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>BODY 1: Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về c&aacute;c yếu tố của một x&atilde; hội l&yacute; tưởng</li>\n<li>BODY 2: Đưa ra c&aacute;c giải ph&aacute;p để đạt được x&atilde; hội l&yacute; tưởng đ&oacute;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O6Q8dKUwJolsRLxRHMKlYAGzgPb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3. Gợi &yacute; viết BODY 1</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ARYZdTorMo8GHUxXiaxlbgKog9K\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B3WzdXi90obr9exqY49ldT5Wg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T3vid37FgouPrLxntpAllbSOgpd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ABpydqwzqoBt8mxtA2clX4h8gmh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FRtld534aoXQ8Cxcdevl45SsgZc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OtESdRTjnoSJwzxYBWkl2MvDgXb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UaoQdMKTxottsFx5xHZl5y6dgTe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ShyKdSzwIoav15xhSR1lkgYvgiN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RBYBdDEZTopKF4xhM6klRT3Qg5e\">Trong BODY 1, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về c&aacute;c yếu tố quan trọng của một x&atilde; hội l&yacute; tưởng: ph&uacute;c lợi x&atilde; hội tốt v&agrave; gi&aacute;o dục miễn ph&iacute;.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RBYBdDEZTopKF4xhM6klRT3Qg5e\">Cấu tr&uacute;c đơn giản l&agrave;: Topic Sentence ➜ Supporting Idea 1 ➜ Supporting idea 2</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Topic sentence:</span></strong></p>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J2Mgd651jokGr5xFFcTlMHOagYg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YIkYdyyfZoikZgxMfM9ly4SYghh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mk2zdFhmloeQGbxZgDwlEsvwgnh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JesqdVbvXoysYjxqtf7lyoDSg7c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-S0GAd5xJ8oGcMrxuRAElpmNagXe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-Jrn8dU6Z6oRIBxx0WqNlvHuWglg\">Để cho ph&eacute;p mọi người tự do theo đuổi ho&agrave;i b&atilde;o, một quốc gia l&yacute; tưởng cần cung cấp c&aacute;c chương tr&igrave;nh ph&uacute;c lợi x&atilde; hội tốt (<strong>good social</strong> <strong>welfare programs</strong>)&nbsp;v&agrave; gi&aacute;o dục miễn ph&iacute; (<strong>free education</strong>)&nbsp;cho c&ocirc;ng d&acirc;n.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">&nbsp;Supporting idea 1:</span></strong></p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZSGudTTeHoUUbwxmgwvlnevNg0d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Br0HdPtt2o6yaDxssU5lFwBbgic\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CXHedb5Q5o0ChTxzjeJlACIHgBe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qw7XdcQDiopHAmxbaJzlaWDZgjb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EAA1dQKV5otLAmxFGgBlpln2gIe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N5dHdBAjeojWA3xMEbCl8pn1gyB\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IAbldxsOzoo2wFxmKA9lpeamg5g\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqSCdzlGco7jtBxE6bllMmO1gac\">Một v&iacute; dụ của ph&uacute;c lợi x&atilde; hội l&agrave; chương tr&igrave;nh thu nhập cơ bản phổ qu&aacute;t (<strong>Universal Basic Income </strong>- <strong>UBI</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqSCdzlGco7jtBxE6bllMmO1gac\">&nbsp; ➜ UBI l&agrave; chương tr&igrave;nh ph&acirc;n phối tiền đều (<strong>distributed at an equal rate</strong>) cho mọi người, bất kể t&igrave;nh trạng việc l&agrave;m (<strong>employment status</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqSCdzlGco7jtBxE6bllMmO1gac\">&nbsp; ➜ UBI gi&uacute;p trang trải c&aacute;c nhu cầu cơ bản của người d&acirc;n (<strong>cover citizens' basic needs</strong>)&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqSCdzlGco7jtBxE6bllMmO1gac\">&nbsp; ➜ giảm &aacute;p lực t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh c&aacute; nh&acirc;n (<strong>individual finances</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TqSCdzlGco7jtBxE6bllMmO1gac\">&nbsp; ➜ cho ph&eacute;p người thụ hưởng (<strong>beneficiaries</strong>) tập trung v&agrave;o c&aacute;c kh&iacute;a cạnh kh&aacute;c của cuộc sống</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 2:</span></strong></p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RJW5dfJhqofjuXxEd7dlCvwzg3b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LQSEdv0Y1oIVaoxMMoxljdOvgOd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HNQNdCbCpoystuxVP43luHtDgeb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HJ7FdScShoqf2QxHEgylSbaAgyf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NFfDdmOXNoOWwZxiNtZl15SMgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A0zKdQFrWoIXtex6mhplQSoegxb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-T2mWd1rtBo8T07x6awTlNUNqg9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MouQd4DBLovc3jxPa79lmsXqgd7\">Gi&aacute;o dục miễn ph&iacute;:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MouQd4DBLovc3jxPa79lmsXqgd7\">&nbsp; ➜ đi học n&ecirc;n l&agrave; quyền cơ bản (<strong>a basic right</strong>) v&agrave; v&igrave; vậy gi&uacute;p cho sinh vi&ecirc;n kh&ocirc;ng phải trả học ph&iacute; (<strong>tuition</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MouQd4DBLovc3jxPa79lmsXqgd7\">&nbsp; ➜ l&acirc;u d&agrave;i sẽ tạo ra lực lượng lao động năng suất (<strong>productive</strong>), hiệu quả (<strong>efficient</strong>) v&agrave; kỹ năng cao hơn (<strong>highly skilled workforce</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MouQd4DBLovc3jxPa79lmsXqgd7\">&nbsp; ➜ th&uacute;c đẩy ph&aacute;t triển kinh tế đất nước (<strong>spur economic development</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MouQd4DBLovc3jxPa79lmsXqgd7\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I85fdLrlqovzpLxkUCfldUM5gEg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4. Gợi &yacute; viết BODY 2</strong> </span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I85fdLrlqovzpLxkUCfldUM5gEg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FkKtdjQLbo1AtlxkzyalC6VXgEc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZT8dluWuoiebixsy4zlDBdDg8f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ub8odKVWsohu3TxKHTylRfJ3gqT\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IO0OdZMbkop2KtxaAgbl07P0g3f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ap4ndJ97bocXozxn7oAl3Txmgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FwiNdcUNSoCW0UxEnPxlYn1NgYe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lsjlde9EKo9cSdxAvmulNTZPgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-QlLCdOUMdo3qamxPqzelvKyCgBY\">Để c&aacute;c yếu tố tr&ecirc;n được thực thi th&igrave; trong BODY 2, YouPass sẽ tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y vai tr&ograve; của ch&iacute;nh phủ v&agrave; gia đ&igrave;nh.&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-QlLCdOUMdo3qamxPqzelvKyCgBY\">Cấu tr&uacute;c đơn giản l&agrave;: Topic Sentence ➜ Supporting Idea 1 ➜ Supporting idea 2</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Topic sentence:</span></strong></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZakddQ7nJoAgFyxpFvNleucyg4d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OBDmdoEGDoDyBgxNOqylocGigdc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PoBydy7ixoRrKIxO5gdlnQbzg7e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-FPwwd6a20oL0khxlV17lQP1fgSh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-CLHQd8Vyjoq587xOQKBlr5EDg4b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QlLCdOUMdo3qamxPqzelvKyCgBY\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-PBKFdBEE3ohu6wxTbLTl257Jgpc\">Ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể c&oacute; một x&atilde; hội l&yacute; tưởng nếu đ&aacute;p ứng đ&uacute;ng <strong>2 điều kiện&nbsp;</strong>- (1): ch&iacute;nh phủ v&agrave; (2): gia đ&igrave;nh l&agrave;m đ&uacute;ng vai tr&ograve; của m&igrave;nh&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 1:</span></strong></p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OOMmd2z40oU1GpxeAiOljjORg6c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IP8udCf4UodaQ1xp6r1lvwiTgHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-FWGcdCLrAodR0zx9hxultvvcg0c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JcusdZSFzovztExclQWl7chLg4e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9rFdK1ipoSiH8x8Lc1lqPoUgYf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZa1dU6WtoYm51x9m3JlC8V6gQe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-G35adIotboSlwYxl0TulS1RkgJh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bi0NdKQXuoLUHbxwWXDlruFtgNc\">Vai tr&ograve; của ch&iacute;nh phủ:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bi0NdKQXuoLUHbxwWXDlruFtgNc\">&nbsp; ➜ &aacute;p dụng thuế cao hơn đối với c&ocirc;ng d&acirc;n gi&agrave;u c&oacute; (<strong>impose higher taxes on its wealthier citizens</strong>) để t&agrave;i trợ cho c&aacute;c chương tr&igrave;nh x&atilde; hội như UBI&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bi0NdKQXuoLUHbxwWXDlruFtgNc\">&nbsp; ➜ ưu ti&ecirc;n x&oacute;a bỏ tham nhũng (<strong>prioritizing rooting out corruption</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bi0NdKQXuoLUHbxwWXDlruFtgNc\">&nbsp; ➜ đảm bảo mọi người đều nhận được phần của m&igrave;nh (<strong>everyone receives their share</strong>) m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng bị quan chức tham nhũng hoặc năng lực k&eacute;m cỏi (<strong>corrupt or incompetent officials</strong>) thao t&uacute;ng&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 2:</span></strong></p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VZnEdzqc4oEV4wxO5mZluCDFgQd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BXimdSddLo8wilxpbXMli5xmgBf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CXfQd5foZotNYvxR3yulUfOegnb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JKs3d2HFfoJfLcxOlhZlsYPPgOc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OVGzda09ioegiAxjp4BlwN6Ugee\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Dc96dxi8Do6jiRxbpzIlbykXgw1\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-SmqNdAdGQozDyNxx9Ufl3QlCgZg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MPAVdAUCFowcuUxI1Wcl7woig2b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Vai tr&ograve; của gia đ&igrave;nh:&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MPAVdAUCFowcuUxI1Wcl7woig2b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp; ➜ cha mẹ ảnh hưởng rất lớn (<strong>massively influence</strong>) đến con c&aacute;i&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MPAVdAUCFowcuUxI1Wcl7woig2b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp; ➜ cha mẹ c&oacute; tr&aacute;ch nhiệm r&egrave;n luyện t&iacute;nh tự gi&aacute;c cho con c&aacute;i (<strong>instilling self-discipline in sb</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MPAVdAUCFowcuUxI1Wcl7woig2b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp; ➜ mục đ&iacute;ch l&agrave; để c&aacute;c thế hệ sau (<strong>successive generations</strong>)<strong> </strong>kh&ocirc;ng coi sự gi&agrave;u c&oacute; l&agrave; điều hiển nhi&ecirc;n (<strong>do not take their wealth for granted</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MPAVdAUCFowcuUxI1Wcl7woig2b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp; ➜ gi&uacute;p con c&aacute;i c&oacute; thể quản l&yacute; th&agrave;nh c&ocirc;ng (<strong>successfully manage</strong>) việc học tập v&agrave; c&aacute;c nhu cầu cơ bản khi trưởng th&agrave;nh (<strong>basic necessities</strong>)</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 109,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction ",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WP15dn1lMomJsLxEitPlS8U9gXc\">Opinions are divided on what the perfect society would be like and what can be done to elevate ourselves to that level. <strong>In my opinion, the government, as well as individual families, must be at the forefront to push human civilization to its peak, where everyone is free to purse their every ambition.</strong></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12908,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 110,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N59Ndj4yFoOnLxxq45rli3HpgKh\"><strong>In order to enable such pursuits, an ideal country would have to allow its citizens access to good social welfare programs and its students free education. </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">With regard to the former, one such program would be the universal basic income (UBI), through which money is distributed to everyone, at an equal rate regardless of their employment status. Such a system could cover citizens&rsquo; basic needs, thus reducing pressure on individual finances, potentially allowing beneficiaries to focus on other aspects of their lives. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">Regarding the latter, attending school and university should be a basic right, and as such, nobody should have to pay tuition. A policy that reflects this view could, in the long run, produce a more productive, efficient, and highly skilled workforce, which thus could spur economic development in the country.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12908,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 111,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2 \n",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S2MOdmCPxo4qcVx0X5Bl7DLxgxd\"><strong>Although these ideals may seem unattainable, if the right conditions are met, this form of society is certainly achievable. </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">One such condition is that, in order to fund social programs like UBI, the government should impose higher taxes on its wealthier citizens. While such tax policies can be controversial, as there is often a lack of transparency associated with how tax revenue is spent, it is possible for the government to win public support by prioritizing rooting out corruption, with the ultimate purpose of guaranteeing that everyone receives their share without it being mishandled by corrupt or incompetent officials. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">The role of the family also cannot be understated in the pursuit of a perfect society. It is obvious that parents massively influence their children; therefore, they should bear the responsibility of instilling self-discipline in them, so that successive generations do not take their wealth for granted, and are able to successfully manage their education and basic necessities as an adult.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12908,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 112,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion ",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SmCXdThwFoHQUTxjfrulZ4RjgYe\">In conclusion, I believe that those living in a utopia must have unrestricted access to universal basic income and to education. It also falls upon the government and families to pave the way for us to achieve the ideal society.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12908,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
